# Share per task for pi0 on LIBERO-Goal, action expert only, first 3 tasks, otherwise as 18_libero_goal_packnet_motor_memory.jobs.
# A task keeps a fixed share of the action expert instead of 25% of what is free: 1/16 (2 of 32 attention units and 4 of
# 64 MLP blocks per layer for the motor memory, 6.25% of every matrix for PackNet; room for 16 tasks) or 1/32 (1 and 2;
# 3.125%; room for 32 tasks). The second phase (core phase, PackNet's retraining) restarts its learning rate (500 warmup
# updates to 2.5e-5, cosine to 2.5e-6) or keeps the sequence's rate at the end of the task's first phase (inherit, as in
# 18). Evaluated on LIBERO's validation initial states (--eval-split val), 50 episodes per task.
s0_goal_expert_mm_share16_restart|-|training/train_libero.py --suite libero_goal --method motor_memory --core-share 0.0625 --phase2-lr restart --model pi0 --train expert --seed 0 --frames-in-memory --eval-split val --stop-after-tasks 3 --out $CVLA_RUNS/libero/libero_goal_val/pi0_expert/motor_memory_share16_restart/s0
s0_goal_expert_pn_share16_restart|-|training/train_libero.py --suite libero_goal --method packnet --packnet-keep-share 0.0625 --phase2-lr restart --model pi0 --train expert --seed 0 --frames-in-memory --eval-split val --stop-after-tasks 3 --out $CVLA_RUNS/libero/libero_goal_val/pi0_expert/packnet_share16_restart/s0
s0_goal_expert_mm_share32_restart|-|training/train_libero.py --suite libero_goal --method motor_memory --core-share 0.03125 --phase2-lr restart --model pi0 --train expert --seed 0 --frames-in-memory --eval-split val --stop-after-tasks 3 --out $CVLA_RUNS/libero/libero_goal_val/pi0_expert/motor_memory_share32_restart/s0
s0_goal_expert_pn_share32_restart|-|training/train_libero.py --suite libero_goal --method packnet --packnet-keep-share 0.03125 --phase2-lr restart --model pi0 --train expert --seed 0 --frames-in-memory --eval-split val --stop-after-tasks 3 --out $CVLA_RUNS/libero/libero_goal_val/pi0_expert/packnet_share32_restart/s0
s0_goal_expert_mm_share16_inherit|-|training/train_libero.py --suite libero_goal --method motor_memory --core-share 0.0625 --model pi0 --train expert --seed 0 --frames-in-memory --eval-split val --stop-after-tasks 3 --out $CVLA_RUNS/libero/libero_goal_val/pi0_expert/motor_memory_share16_inherit/s0
s0_goal_expert_pn_share16_inherit|-|training/train_libero.py --suite libero_goal --method packnet --packnet-keep-share 0.0625 --model pi0 --train expert --seed 0 --frames-in-memory --eval-split val --stop-after-tasks 3 --out $CVLA_RUNS/libero/libero_goal_val/pi0_expert/packnet_share16_inherit/s0
